---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Orbit from '../components/Orbit.astro';
import SystemEntry from '../components/SystemEntry.astro';
---

<Layout title="Schaake Solutions - Business Operating Systems, Built AI-First">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-page px-5 md:px-10">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="grid gap-10 border-b border-ink pt-11 pb-14 md:grid-cols-[1.25fr_0.75fr] md:gap-14 md:pt-18 md:pb-20">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-4.5 font-serif text-xl leading-[1.3] italic md:text-2xl">Hi, I'm Mark Schaake.</p>
        <h1 class="mb-8 font-serif text-display font-medium text-ink">I build business operating systems, <em class="whitespace-nowrap text-accent">AI-first.</em></h1>
        <p class="mb-9 max-w-[36rem] text-body md:text-sub">
          One system a business runs on: portals for everyone involved, the money flowing through it, and the day-to-day processes. Right now I'm working on projects for fun, and I'm happy to help when someone needs a system like that.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
          <a href="mailto:info@schaake.solutions" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-accent">
            Get in Touch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://markschaake.com" class="border-b-[1.5px] border-accent pb-0.5 font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-accent">Writing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center border-t border-rule pt-7 md:justify-start md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-8">
        <Orbit class="h-auto w-[140px] md:w-full md:max-w-[300px]" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What I Build -->
    <section id="build" class="scroll-mt-6 border-b border-ink py-16 md:py-22">
      <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2 md:mb-12 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:gap-5">
        <span class="font-mono text-label text-accent uppercase">§ 1</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-h2 font-medium text-ink">What I Build</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid border-t border-rule lg:grid-cols-3">

          <div class="border-b border-rule py-7 last:border-b-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:pt-8 lg:pb-2 lg:pr-8 lg:border-r">
            <span class="mb-7 block font-mono text-label text-ink-3 uppercase">1.1</span>
            <svg class="mb-5 block size-14" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke-width="1.3" aria-hidden="true"><g class="stroke-ink"><rect x="4" y="4" width="12" height="12" /><rect x="40" y="4" width="12" height="12" /><rect x="4" y="40" width="12" height="12" /><rect x="40" y="40" width="12" height="12" /><path d="M16 16l4 4M40 16l-4 4M16 40l4-4M40 40l-4-4" /></g><rect x="20" y="20" width="16" height="16" class="fill-logo-cyan" /></svg>
            <h3 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-h3 font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink">Portals for Every Stakeholder</h3>
            <p class="mb-5">
              Everyone who touches the business gets their own view of the same system, whether they're staff, customers, partners, or members. Each person sees what they need and can act on it themselves.
            </p>
            <ul class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.55]">
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Role-based portals on one shared data model</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Self-service for customers and members</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Back-office tools for the people running things</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Notifications and documents in one place</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="border-b border-rule py-7 last:border-b-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:pt-8 lg:pb-2 lg:border-r lg:px-8">
            <span class="mb-7 block font-mono text-label text-ink-3 uppercase">1.2</span>
            <svg class="mb-5 block size-14" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke-width="1.3" aria-hidden="true"><path class="stroke-ink" d="M6 18h36l-8-8M50 38H14l8 8" /><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="6" class="fill-logo-cyan" /></svg>
            <h3 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-h3 font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink">Payments & Money Flows</h3>
            <p class="mb-5">
              Money moving in and out is where business software has to be right. I build the billing and payment flows into the same system, so payments, balances, and records stay in step.
            </p>
            <ul class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.55]">
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Billing, invoices, and recurring payments</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Card and bank (ACH) payments</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Ledgers, balances, and reconciliation</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Alerts when a payment fails</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="border-b border-rule py-7 last:border-b-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:pt-8 lg:pb-2 lg:pl-8">
            <span class="mb-7 block font-mono text-label text-ink-3 uppercase">1.3</span>
            <svg class="mb-5 block size-14" viewBox="0 0 56 56" fill="none" stroke-width="1.3" aria-hidden="true"><g class="stroke-ink"><circle cx="10" cy="28" r="5" /><circle cx="46" cy="12" r="5" /><circle cx="46" cy="44" r="5" /><path d="M15 28h10M25 28c6 0 6-16 16-16M25 28c6 0 6 16 16 16" /></g><rect x="22" y="23" width="10" height="10" class="fill-logo-cyan" transform="rotate(45 27 28)" /></svg>
            <h3 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-h3 font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink">Workflows, Built AI-First</h3>
            <p class="mb-5">
              I design the business processes and the AI together from the start, so AI does real work inside day-to-day operations instead of sitting off to the side.
            </p>
            <ul class="text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.55]">
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Business processes as clear, auditable workflows</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">AI that drafts, reviews, and surfaces context</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">Automation for repetitive back-office work</li>
              <li class="border-t border-dashed border-rule py-2.5">People in the loop where judgment matters</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Systems in Production -->
    <section id="systems" class="scroll-mt-6 border-b border-ink py-16 md:py-22">
      <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2 md:mb-12 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:gap-5">
        <span class="font-mono text-label text-accent uppercase">§ 2</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-h2 font-medium text-ink">Systems in Production</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-12 max-w-[46rem] font-serif text-lead text-ink">
        Two of the systems I've built and still look after. Both are the kind of software I enjoy most: one place where a whole operation runs.
      </p>
      <SystemEntry number="No. 1" title="An operating system for equipment finance lenders">
        The platform from my previous business: one system that equipment finance lenders run their lending on, from new deals through servicing, with portals for the people involved. I built it over roughly a decade and still maintain it as a software service.
      </SystemEntry>
      <SystemEntry number="No. 2" title="An operating system for my tennis club">
        Pro bono software for running my tennis club, with portals for everyone involved, members included. It launched in fall 2026, and I'm still maintaining it and adding to it.
      </SystemEntry>
      <p class="border-t border-rule pt-8 text-ink-2">
        I've also done consulting for AI House (formerly AI2 Incubator) and worked on a range of other projects.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Get in Touch -->
    <section id="contact" class="-mx-5 mt-10 scroll-mt-6 bg-ink px-5 py-16 text-on-ink md:mx-0 md:mt-14 md:rounded md:px-14 md:py-20">
      <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2 md:mb-12 md:flex-row md:items-baseline md:gap-5">
        <span class="font-mono text-label text-accent-bright uppercase">§ 3</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-h2 font-medium text-white">Get in Touch</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-10 max-w-[40rem] font-serif text-lead-lg text-white">
        Have a system you need built, or want to compare notes? Send me an email.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:info@schaake.solutions" class="inline-block border-b-[3px] border-accent-bright font-bold break-words text-mail text-accent-bright transition-colors hover:border-white hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-accent-bright">info@schaake.solutions</a>
      <p class="mt-7">
        Prefer to talk? <a href="https://calendly.com/mark-schaake/30min" class="font-semibold text-white underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-accent-bright focus-visible:outline-accent-bright">Book a 30-minute call</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
